- Building serverless ETL workflows on AWS
- Processing nested JSON data with Python and Pandas
- Integrating AWS services using Boto3
- Converting structured data into Parquet
- Schema discovery and metadata management with AWS Glue
- Querying S3-based datasets using Amazon Athena
- Monitoring serverless execution through CloudWatch

